Maintainer: Sébastien Lê <sebastien.le@institut-agro.fr>
Description: Provides sensory and consumer data analyses for fixed-list
    methods (QDA, confidence ellipses, CATA and JAR), holistic methods
    (Napping and sorting), and preference mapping. Analyses rely primarily
    on SensoMineR and FactoMineR and provide reproducible R code for use in
    the jamovi Rj Editor.
